{"step_index":228,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T07:35:56Z","input_tokens":6626,"cache_read_tokens":412928,"output_tokens":1138,"thinking":"Dry-run output for the task is error-free. Performance is at 1.84 seconds per 1080p frame with all six processing stages active on the CPU. Now, the task is ready for execution.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_board","args":{"since":"28"}},{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"python \\\"C:\\\\Users\\\\86052\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\a98b6c71-b658-48ee-9b28-e9a1c116099c\\\\scratch\\\\verify_v6_sv_metrics.py\\\" \\\"D:\\\\项目session\\\\blender-supercar\\\\renders_v6\\\\test\\\\sv_test_*.jpg\\\"\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"5000","toolSummary":"\"Audit PIL/NumPy metrics on 5 prototype V6 Spider-Verse frames\""}},{"name":"write_file","args":{"Append":"true","Content":"\"\\n---\\n\\n## V6《蜘蛛侠：纵横宇宙》风格化特别版（Spider-Verse Stylized Edition）\\n\\n在 100% 保留 V5 写实工程不动的前提下，新增独立的 **V6 平行宇宙漫画风格化全链路**（详见 [docs/README_V6_SPIDERVERSE.md](docs/README_V6_SPIDERVERSE.md)）：\\n\\n- **工程文件**：`v6_spiderverse/v6_stage_lookdev.blend`（美漫半调网点/交叉排线材质 + 3D 变宽手绘墨线 + `V6_09_ComicFX` 三维翼尖涡流彩带与车轮残影弧）、`v6_spiderverse/v6_stage_anim_sv.blend`（12 fps On-Twos 局部抽帧 + 三幕平行宇宙色彩剧本 + `Comp_V6_SpiderVerse` 多通道合成器）。\\n- **核心视听特性**：\\n  - **安全 12 fps On-Twos 抽帧**：世界轨迹与 26 机位保持 24 fps 平滑跟拍，车身次级姿态、方向盘、悬挂与三维速度特效按 2 帧一拍设为 `CONSTANT`；\\n  - **三幕平行宇宙切换**：Act I 迈尔斯美漫黄昏（`E-1610`）→ 次元撕裂 → Act II 格温 Kuwahara 水彩表现主义（`E-65`）→ 次元撕裂 → Act III 2099 暗黑紫外霓虹（`E-928`）+ `f=312..313` / `f=1698..1699` 黑白赤红版画冲击帧；\\n  - **焦平面红青印刷错位（CMYK Misregistration）**：Cryptomatte 锁定主角赛车 100% 锐利，焦外背景红青色散偏移；\\n  - **蜘蛛侠声学混音（`pipeline/synth_sfx_sv.py`）**：F1 V6 引擎声叠加黑胶换挡瞬态、次元故障音高撕裂、水彩合唱尾韵与 2099 超低音冲击震爆。\\n- **V6 专属产物（`renders_v6/`）**：\\n  - 26 张风格化剧照 `renders_v6/stills/shot_*.jpg`、三幕总览 `contact_sheet_v6.jpg`、斜切分镜漫画海报 **[renders_v6/stills/comic_page_sheet.jpg](renders_v6/stills/comic_page_sheet.jpg)**；\\n  - 三段 4 秒展示片段 `clip1_miles_1610.mp4`、`clip2_gwen_65.mp4`、`clip3_2099_impact.mp4` 及 12 秒合辑 **[renders_v6/v6_spiderverse_showcase_12s.mp4](renders_v6/v6_spiderverse_showcase_12s.mp4)**。\\n\"","Path":"\"d:\\\\项目session\\\\blender-supercar\\\\README.md\""}}]}
